01:03:11.200 --> 01:03:17.200
effective at appropriately targeting where those&nbsp;
vaccines need to be, with fair allocation across&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:17.200 --> 01:03:21.680
the country. And this is obviously as we make&nbsp;
these weekly adjustments, just a final point to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:21.680 --> 01:03:28.240
underline, for the avoidance of doubt. Everybody&nbsp;
